WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:05.839
My favorite class that I took was called
Business, Society and Ethics, where

2
00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:09.542
we learn the different ethical principles
and apply them to business practices.

3
00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:13.480
What I really enjoyed
most about this class is how interactive

4
00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:14.748
the professor made it.

5
00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:18.218
The professor really challenged
our notions about what was deemed ethical

6
00:00:18.218 --> 00:00:20.754
and how we would respond
to different situations.

7
00:00:20.754 --> 00:00:23.723
He really challenged us to use different
ethical principles

8
00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:26.860
in creating arguments
and looking at all opposing sides.

